OracleAdapter.setPriceFeeds
├── when called by the owner with valid, equal-length arrays
│   ├── it sets priceFeeds[token] = feed for each token
│   ├── it sets heartbeats[token] = heartbeat[i] for each token
│   └── it emits PriceFeedSet event with the provided arrays
├── when updating existing entries
│   └── it overwrites previous feed and heartbeat values
├── when arrays have different lengths
│   └── it reverts with LengthMismatch
├── when any token or feed address is zero
│   └── it reverts with ZeroAddress and does not change any state
├── when any heartbeat value is zero
│   └── it reverts with ZeroAmount and does not change any state
└── when called by a non-owner
    └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount including the caller
